udra"},{"time":187.06,"text":"Kita berbagi tawa dan berdansa"},{"time":192.22,"text":"Walau di tengah duka dan deras air mata"},{"time":197.75,"text":"Satu romansa, kita tiada dua"},{"time":202.55,"text":"Antara aku, kamu, dan samudra"},{"time":207.88,"text":"Kita berbagi tawa dan berdansa"},{"time":213.07,"text":"Walau di tengah duka dan deras air mata"},{"time":218.46,"text":"Satu romansa, kita tiada dua"},{"time":223.47,"text":"Itulah aku, kamu, dan samudra"},{"time":228.96,"text":"• • •"}]}}}